  "releaseNotes": "Initial alpha release of Plugin.Maui.TvDPad.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t- Cross-platform D-Pad input abstraction for .NET MAUI\n\t\t\t- Supports Android TV / Google TV DPAD navigation\n\t\t\t- Exposes directional events (Up, Down, Left, Right, Center)\n\t\t\t- Designed for remote-control and TV-focused MAUI apps\n\t\t\t- Lightweight, dependency-free implementation\n\n\t\t\tNotes:\n\t\t\t- API surface may change before 1.0.0\n\t\t\t- Feedback and issues are welcome",
